#. (itstool) path: item/p
#: /home/cyrille/Documents/github/build/help/C/xiphos-11-interface.page:344
msgid ""
"Read Aloud - If you enable this, then <app>Xiphos</app> will funnel all "
"selected verses through a text-to-speech system. On Linux, <app>Xiphos</app> "
"uses the <app>festival</app> TTS, often installed by default in Linux "
"distributions. On Windows, and on Linux systems that provide it, "
"<app>Xiphos</app> can instead use the operating system's own text-to-speech "
"(\"System TTS\"), so no separate speech engine needs to be installed."
msgstr ""
"朗读 - 启用此项后，<app>Xiphos</app> 会将所有选中的经文送入文本转语音系统。"
"在 Linux 上，<app>Xiphos</app> 使用 <app>festival</app> 语音合成，它通常在 "
"Linux 发行版中默认安装。在 Windows 以及提供该功能的 Linux 系统上，"
"<app>Xiphos</app> 也可以改用操作系统自带的文本转语音（“系统 TTS”），因此无需"
"另外安装语音引擎。"

