#. (itstool) path: page/p
#: /home/cyrille/Documents/github/build/help/C/xiphos-42-journals.page:76
msgid ""
"Editing a journal or prayer list is done by right-clicking the module name "
"to get its context menu, whose middle item is <gui>Open in Editor</gui> "
"(also offered as a dedicated <gui>Edit</gui> item on the same context menu, "
"for quicker access). The sections and subsections will be listed in the left "
